    "title": "Appleseed Festival is event frozen in time - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Audora Burg ,\n1 days ago It’s September, and autumn — and apple season — which can only mean it’s time for the beloved Fort Wayne tradition: the Johnny Appleseed Festival. The 51st edition returns to Johnny Appleseed Park, just off the Memorial Coliseum parking lot, from 10 a.m.-6 p.m. Saturday, Sept. 19, and 10 a.m.-5 p.m., Sunday, Sept. 20. Read full article\n3",
